This is not to fix the intercept! This is just to add the column of ones explicit. When a model contain effects with different sizes, any may differ from the outcome size, them you need to make the intercept explicit as we have to do with the SPDE models. However, you should not have the default intercept from the formula plus the explicit one. So, it is why we take out the default intercept by having either +0 or -1 in the formula.

